%% Language components connected through schemas
flowchart TB
  Profile[Candidate Profile] --> Planner[Interview Planner]
  Knowledge[Retrieved Knowledge] --> Planner
  Planner --> PlanSchema[Validated Interview Plan]
  PlanSchema --> Generator[Question Generator]
  Profile --> Generator
  Generator --> QuestionSchema[Validated Interview Question]
  QuestionSchema --> Evaluator[Answer Evaluator]
  Answer[Candidate Answer] --> Evaluator
  Evaluator --> EvaluationSchema[Validated Answer Evaluation]
  EvaluationSchema --> Decision[Deterministic Decision Service]
  EvaluationSchema --> Reporter[Report Generator]
  Session[Completed Session Evidence] --> Reporter
  Reporter --> ReportSchema[Validated Interview Report]
